  },
  {
    label: 'Curriculum alignment',
    text: 'Directors must show daily activities connect to GELDS and GOLD, but linking observations to standards is manual and inconsistent.',
  },
  {
    label: 'Staffing & ratios',
    text: 'Real-time ratio compliance and schedule coverage are hard to monitor without dedicated tools — especially during busy drop-off.',
  },
  {
    label: 'Director mobility',
    text: 'Directors live on the floor, not at a desk — legacy software forces them back to a desktop for approvals, messaging, and oversight.',
  },
  {
    label: 'Language barriers',
    text: 'Many Georgia families prefer Spanish; most software treats translation as an afterthought instead of day-one infrastructure.',
