  { title: 'Human review always', body: 'AI drafts and summarizes; staff approve every log and narrative before families see it.' },
  { title: 'One communications platform', body: 'Announcements, newsletters, staff comms, parent messaging, and push alerts — not scattered blasts and group texts.' },
  { title: 'Ask Caira for parents', body: 'Parents ask about their child\'s day and get answers grounded in approved logs — with source observations cited.' },
  { title: 'Georgia-ready', body: 'DECAL compliance, GELDS/GOLD, and CACFP built in — not generic checklists.' },
